<Database>
    <!-- Community Resource Pack -->
    <!-- 
	I recommend you use Notepad++ to view this document, use ALT+2 (With notepad++) to collaspe the document into viewing format.
	TAGS have been set up to help the user search for related exams. Using Ctrl+F you should be able to find 
	exams using some of these tags (general terms used to describe the exam you are after).
	These exams have been added by their original developers to be used by any modder that wishes for these to be
	apart of their mod. Simply add this mod as a dependency and reference them.
	It is recommended that modders avoid using the same naming convention used by this mod EXM_CRP_*NAME* to help
	prevent conflicts with their own mods. 
	
	Dont forget to check the room tags, we can change these to anything required but you can just copy these if need be. E.G.
	They will generally be tagged from the author that created them. We have added a CRP tag to every treatment that may need it.
	<Tag>CRP_MOD</Tag>
	
	<RequiredRoomTags>
		<Tag>observation</Tag>
		<Tag>icu</Tag>	
		<Tag>gyneco_office</Tag>	
		<Tag>gyneco_inpatient_office</Tag>
		<Tag>receipt</Tag>
	</RequiredRoomTags>
	-->

